#: ../../source/evaluation/leaderboard.md:1 daf164f4a6fa484b9b7cd13c8f79cf5a
msgid "基准排行榜"
msgstr "Benchmark Leaderboard"

#: ../../source/evaluation/leaderboard.md:3 06f367fadff14792bc4a93a531c4c4f9
msgid ""
"本排行榜展示 UniKT 框架在主流公开教育数据集上的统一基准评测结果。所有模型均在统一的数据预处理、学生级 5 "
"折交叉验证划分与标准化指标计算口径下完成评估。"
msgstr ""
"This leaderboard showcases the standardized benchmark evaluation results "
"of the UniKT framework across mainstream public educational datasets. All"
" models are evaluated under unified data preprocessing, student-level "
"5-fold cross-validation splits, and standardized metric computation "
"protocols."

#: ../../source/evaluation/leaderboard.md:6 0de4016071cd4614b4154c08d0b56107
msgid "**筛选与检索**：可通过顶部标签切换不同数据集，在输入框中输入模型名称实时检索。"
msgstr ""
"**Filter & Search**: Switch datasets using the top tabs or search in real"
" time by typing a model name into the input field."

#: ../../source/evaluation/leaderboard.md:7 edfab05b8bc54f73bc3b31a5f7cb3dce
msgid "**查看 5 折详情**：将鼠标悬停在各模型的 AUC 或 ACC 数值上，可查看该模型全部 5 折的具体测试成绩。"
msgstr ""
"**View 5-Fold Details**: Hover over the AUC or ACC value of each model to"
" view detailed test performance across all 5 individual folds."

#: ../../source/evaluation/leaderboard.md:8 ce14cbc3e1bc400286bbd092ef4d5219
msgid "**评测规范**：详细的数据集划分、早停策略与指标对齐原则请参考[评测协议与指标](protocol.md)。"
msgstr ""
"**Evaluation Specifications**: Refer to [Evaluation Protocol & "
"Metrics](protocol.md) for details on dataset splitting, early stopping "
"strategies, and metric alignment principles."

#: ../../source/evaluation/leaderboard.md:25 416e99c8f173493aadba0514c39f8320
msgid "评测规范概述"
msgstr "Overview of Evaluation Specifications"

#: ../../source/evaluation/leaderboard.md:27 7214519bb84a453aace43c5b692671c9
msgid "为确保不同知识追踪模型结果的绝对可比性，UniKT 遵循以下统一基准设置："
msgstr ""
"To ensure absolute comparability across different knowledge tracing "
"models, UniKT adheres to the following unified benchmark settings:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/leaderboard.md:29 68ab363eafe14b6c821843fe31ba832c
msgid "**验证协议**：采用严格的学生级分层 5 折交叉验证，杜绝同一学生在时序上的数据泄露，汇报 5 折测试集均值与标准差。"
msgstr ""
"**Validation Protocol**: Employs strict student-level stratified 5-fold "
"cross-validation to prevent temporal data leakage for the same student, "
"reporting 5-fold test set mean and standard deviation."

#: ../../source/evaluation/leaderboard.md:30 f81a5d27cc5f41a697d541f66e5d9aee
msgid "**早停机制**：监控验证集 AUC 指标，设置容忍轮数 `patience = 10`，训练终止时自动恢复验证集表现最优的检查点。"
msgstr ""
"**Early Stopping Mechanism**: Monitors validation AUC with `patience = "
"10`, automatically restoring the checkpoint with optimal validation "
"performance upon training termination."

#: ../../source/evaluation/leaderboard.md:31 33a536b2d99245cfa250fb5e4e0d3961
msgid "**因果对齐**：预测严格遵守因果时序，根据历史作答状态预测下一步作答表现（下一题预测口径）。"
msgstr ""
"**Causal Alignment**: Predictions strictly adhere to causal temporal "
"order, predicting the next response performance based on historical "
"interaction states (next-item prediction protocol)."

#: ../../source/evaluation/leaderboard.md:32 42296f3e3073418ba6f5e936ded73659
msgid "**指标口径**：统一计算全序列各有效预测位置的二分类 AUC 与 ACC（阈值 0.5）。"
msgstr ""
"**Metric Definition**: Standardized binary classification AUC and ACC "
"(0.5 threshold) computed across all valid prediction positions in "
"complete sequences."
